OL,3,GNEWSA'Drastic measure' to stop tourists
OL,4,Apaddling in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FFences are set to be installed in a
OL,7,Fvillage voted the most beautiful in the
OL,8,Fworld to stop hundreds of tourists
OL,9,Fpaddling in a river.
OL,11,FBibury in Gloucestershire is home to
OL,12,Fabout 600 people, but can see up to
OL,13,F20,000 visitors a day, which this
OL,14,Fsummer caused a number of issues for
OL,15,Fwildlife in the River Coln.
OL,17,FCraig Chapman, chair of Bibury Parish
OL,18,FCouncil, said the authority voted for
OL,19,Fthe "drastic measure" to protect the
OL,20,Fwater's swans, ducks, voles and fish.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
