OL,3,GNEWSA'Drastic measure' to stop tourists
OL,4,Apaddling in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Jason Edwards, deputy chair of the
OL,7,FCoach Tourism Association, said he was
OL,8,Fconcerned more restrictions could stop
OL,9,Fcoach companies visiting the area
OL,10,Faltogether and Bibury had already
OL,11,Fbecome a "red flag".
